  ('Carb source', 'SunRice', 'Low GI White Rice, DRY (uncooked)', 70.0, 'Coles/Woolworths/IGA', 249.0, 5.2, 54.4, 0.7, 0.7, 4.0, 'DRY WEIGHT basis (label states 14.3 servings/pack @ 70g dry). Cooked rice weighs ~2.5-3x dry due to water absorption - do not apply these figures to cooked portions without converting. Distinct product from existing ''White Medium Grain Rice, cooked'' row.', 'Label-verified (Woolworths official product NIP, pulled 06/07/26)'),
