  ('Protein', 'Woolworths', 'Beef Mince, raw (standard)', 100.0, 'Woolworths', 232.0, 18.1, 1.0, 18.0, 0.0, 56.0, 'Standard mince ~14-18% fat. Cook loss ~25%, yielding ~75g cooked per 100g raw. Higher fat than lean variant but budget-friendly for maintenance phases.', 'Label-verified (Woolworths official NIP, pulled 06/07/26)'),
