  ('Protein', 'Woolworths', 'Lamb Mince, raw', 100.0, 'Woolworths', 206.0, 18.0, 1.0, 15.0, 0.0, 56.0, 'Higher fat than beef (~15%), richer flavour. Good for off-season/maintenance phases. Cook loss ~25-30%.', 'Label-verified (Woolworths official NIP, pulled 06/07/26)'),
