  ('Vegetable/Colour', 'Woolworths', 'Broccoli, fresh, raw', 100.0, 'Woolworths/Coles/IGA', 31.0, 4.7, 0.4, 0.3, 2.0, 22.0, 'Micronutrient-dense, very low energy density. Calorie figure (31 kcal/100g) from official label; appears high vs macro sum due to plant-matrix effect in whole vegetables. Use raw or steamed without added fat. Good for fight-week prep (low FODMAP when cooked).', 'Label-verified (Woolworths official NIP, pulled 06/07/26)'),
  ('Vegetable/Colour', 'Woolworths', 'Broccoli Florets, frozen, raw', 100.0, 'Woolworths', 24.0, 2.9, 1.2, 0.5, 2.5, 13.0, 'Snap-frozen at peak, nutritionally equivalent to fresh. Convenient for meal prep. Slightly lower protein/higher fibre vs fresh (likely due to floret selection).', 'Label-verified (Woolworths official NIP, pulled 06/07/26)'),
