  ('Fat source', 'Cobram Estate', 'Extra Virgin Olive Oil, classic', 15.0, 'Coles/Woolworths/IGA', 135.0, 0.0, 0.0, 15.0, 0.0, 0.0, 'Australian EVOO, Doongara river region. 15ml serving (~1 tbsp). Stable cooking oil for reload/maintenance. Vitamin E source (~7mg per tbsp). First press.', 'Label-verified (Woolworths official NIP, pulled 06/07/26)'),
